(5907400, 859902, 63716, '<td valign="top">A bit too much light fall-off in this one - looks like was lit by a single flash and it''s thrown the background into darkness.<br/> <br/>Appreciate for an action shot you need a quick shutter so can''t use a long exposure to get some ambient, but in that case it may have been better to re-frame so that there wasn''t so much featureless darkness in the background.</td>', 'A bit too much light fall-off in this one - looks like was lit by a single flash and it''s thrown the background into darkness. Appreciate for an action shot you need a quick shutter so can''t use a long exposure to get some ambient, but in that case it may have been better to re-frame so that there wasn''t so much featureless darkness in the background.', '2010-03-17 00:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
