(5907993, 859998, 72929, '<td valign="top">Hmm lets see.. looks cessna 172-ish, you seem to be coming in somewhat fast which means you prolly don''t have your flaps down yet (or if you do it''s barely open, like 10 degrees), and there is a slight crosswind coming from the right.<br/> <br/>That said, it''s a pretty neat photo- I respect the difficulty in taking a shot like this because I''ve sat in those cramped cockpits. Other voters will probably prefer cityscape shots.</td>', 'Hmm lets see.. looks cessna 172-ish, you seem to be coming in somewhat fast which means you prolly don''t have your flaps down yet (or if you do it''s barely open, like 10 degrees), and there is a slight crosswind coming from the right. That said, it''s a pretty neat photo- I respect the difficulty in taking a shot like this because I''ve sat in those cramped cockpits. Other voters will probably prefer cityscape shots.', '2010-03-17 09:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
