(5908350, 860764, 109541, '<td valign="top">Nice light and nice story.  If they were my girls, I''d tell them to stay in the car.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice light and nice story.  If they were my girls, I''d tell them to stay in the car.  Good job.', '2010-03-17 13:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5908355, 860879, 109541, '<td valign="top">Reminds me when my wife learned to drive.  This is a neat image and likely was taken at night, but it''s a bit to "well exposed" to tell me it''s a night study.  I think I would like this more if the background light dropped off.  Looks like it would be hard to do without a grad filter as I suspect the whole parking lot was lit.</td>', 'Reminds me when my wife learned to drive.  This is a neat image and likely was taken at night, but it''s a bit to "well exposed" to tell me it''s a night study.  I think I would like this more if the background light dropped off.  Looks like it would be hard to do without a grad filter as I suspect the whole parking lot was lit.', '2010-03-17 13:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5908360, 860163, 109541, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I like the monotone treatment.</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I like the monotone treatment.', '2010-03-17 13:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
