(5908842, 861085, 115307, '<td valign="top">10 from me. This is gorgeous. I think if had rotated to the left a little for a more interesting composition. But its not like its easy to see what you are doing in the dark :-P. You managed amazing clarity and focus.</td>', '10 from me. This is gorgeous. I think if had rotated to the left a little for a more interesting composition. But its not like its easy to see what you are doing in the dark :-P. You managed amazing clarity and focus.', '2010-03-17 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
