(5908844, 861341, 115307, '<td valign="top">This image is so cool! And then I look at the McDonalds sign, and it sort of loses its effect. The sign is very distracting. Nevertheless, the rest of the picture is awesome. I love how the sparks on the left seems like they are crashing and bouncing off of the edge of the shot.</td>', 'This image is so cool! And then I look at the McDonalds sign, and it sort of loses its effect. The sign is very distracting. Nevertheless, the rest of the picture is awesome. I love how the sparks on the left seems like they are crashing and bouncing off of the edge of the shot.', '2010-03-17 19:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5908845, 861251, 115307, '<td valign="top">Brilliant sky!</td>', 'Brilliant sky!', '2010-03-17 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
