(5908953, 860389, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours in the reflection are wonderful.  For me the dark areas on the left and right don''t add anything to the image.  Cropping to square and straightening the horizon I think would help tremendously. (Or rather than straightening the horizon, maybe just a little pull of free transform in the upper right corner.  It just looks like it''s listing a little to the right).</td>', 'The colours in the reflection are wonderful.  For me the dark areas on the left and right don''t add anything to the image.  Cropping to square and straightening the horizon I think would help tremendously. (Or rather than straightening the horizon, maybe just a little pull of free transform in the upper right corner.  It just looks like it''s listing a little to the right).', '2010-03-17 20:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
