(5909076, 861255, 15511, '<td valign="top">Yeah, not so unusual. <br/>Handicap parking spaces are practically required everywhere in California. My local motorcycle dealer was even required to have handicap-accessible restrooms when remodeling the store...<br/>We have handicap license plates for motorcycles, too. One of my friends received one after becoming disabled by crushing his ankle in an accident.</td>', 'Yeah, not so unusual. Handicap parking spaces are practically required everywhere in California. My local motorcycle dealer was even required to have handicap-accessible restrooms when remodeling the store...We have handicap license plates for motorcycles, too. One of my friends received one after becoming disabled by crushing his ankle in an accident.', '2010-03-17 22:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909080, 860960, 115307, '<td valign="top">Love this. Absolutely gorgeous.<br/>I love the contrast between the starry sky in the left top corner, and the remains of the setting sun in the bottom right. 10</td>', 'Love this. Absolutely gorgeous.I love the contrast between the starry sky in the left top corner, and the remains of the setting sun in the bottom right. 10', '2010-03-17 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909082, 861110, 115307, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see the whole wheel. But still very cool photo.</td>', 'I would have loved to see the whole wheel. But still very cool photo.', '2010-03-17 22:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909084, 861150, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! You are not quite getting the high score that the beauty here deserves from me because it is not technically a night shot and some of your competitors managed equally gorgeous shots during true night time. Still I''ll give you an 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot! You are not quite getting the high score that the beauty here deserves from me because it is not technically a night shot and some of your competitors managed equally gorgeous shots during true night time. Still I''ll give you an 8', '2010-03-17 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909087, 861181, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is by far the most interesting of the "streaks of light from a moving vehicle" shots in this challenge. Great shot!</td>', 'This is by far the most interesting of the "streaks of light from a moving vehicle" shots in this challenge. Great shot!', '2010-03-17 22:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909088, 860602, 38032, '<td valign="top">An amazing and "hip" feeling capture.  THe subject, angle, and even the simple composition really work - also the warm and cool colors are very eye catching. 8</td>', 'An amazing and "hip" feeling capture.  THe subject, angle, and even the simple composition really work - also the warm and cool colors are very eye catching. 8', '2010-03-17 22:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
