(5909193, 860916, 25773, '<td valign="top">10<br/>It looks like after an eyeglass cleaning... Great dynamic range and sharpness and enviably spot-on white balance.... and a gorgeous city.</td>', '10It looks like after an eyeglass cleaning... Great dynamic range and sharpness and enviably spot-on white balance.... and a gorgeous city.', '2010-03-18 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909219, 860895, 115716, '<td valign="top">A photo that tells a story - stunning!</td>', 'A photo that tells a story - stunning!', '2010-03-18 00:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909228, 860898, 115716, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2010-03-18 00:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909243, 860497, 66398, '<td valign="top">Not voting and just peaked in to see what was here but after seeing all the thumbnails and clicking on a few I had to come back and say I love this shot. There''s just something about it. I don''t know where it really is but for me this looks like a hospital and the title suggests imminent death for someone... maybe in the room to the left where that wheeled thing (an oxygen cart maybe?) is sitting. Yet it is a calm quiet death. Peaceful. and there is a light at the end where there is love. Blinding love just beyond that door at the end of the hallway.<br/> <br/>I didn''t comment on anyone else''s photo in this challenge either. Yours spoke to me.</td>', 'Not voting and just peaked in to see what was here but after seeing all the thumbnails and clicking on a few I had to come back and say I love this shot. There''s just something about it. I don''t know where it really is but for me this looks like a hospital and the title suggests imminent death for someone... maybe in the room to the left where that wheeled thing (an oxygen cart maybe?) is sitting. Yet it is a calm quiet death. Peaceful. and there is a light at the end where there is love. Blinding love just beyond that door at the end of the hallway. I didn''t comment on anyone else''s photo in this challenge either. Yours spoke to me.', '2010-03-18 00:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909266, 861150, 106910, '<td valign="top">My problem with this photo is that it''s not at night. Had it been taken at night, the photo wouldn''t have nearly the impact that it has now. I really like it (honestly, I think it''s a beautiful shot), but it doesn''t seem to fit the challenge.</td>', 'My problem with this photo is that it''s not at night. Had it been taken at night, the photo wouldn''t have nearly the impact that it has now. I really like it (honestly, I think it''s a beautiful shot), but it doesn''t seem to fit the challenge.', '2010-03-18 02:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5909283, 861194, 28427, '<td valign="top">Amusing how he''s shooting something in the sky with the on-board flash activated.  In a way I would have liked some more detail in your photograph, especially the main subject.</td>', 'Amusing how he''s shooting something in the sky with the on-board flash activated.  In a way I would have liked some more detail in your photograph, especially the main subject.', '2010-03-18 03:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
