(5912378, 860764, 17771, '<td valign="top">So much impact in this shot. Girl in front is in perfect focus.  DOF adds a lot. The lighting creates a lot of impact too.  Awesome.</td>', 'So much impact in this shot. Girl in front is in perfect focus.  DOF adds a lot. The lighting creates a lot of impact too.  Awesome.', '2010-03-21 23:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912380, 860925, 85849, '<td valign="top">It seems to be floating in space. The effect is quite nice. <br/> <br/>The shot is nice and sharp. It does seem to be on a bit of a tilt. I might have straightened it.<br/> <br/>Excellent shot!</td>', 'It seems to be floating in space. The effect is quite nice.  The shot is nice and sharp. It does seem to be on a bit of a tilt. I might have straightened it. Excellent shot!', '2010-03-21 23:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912381, 861085, 85849, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2010-03-21 23:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912384, 861158, 85849, '<td valign="top">ummm...</td>', 'ummm...', '2010-03-21 23:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912386, 860962, 85849, '<td valign="top">ummm...</td>', 'ummm...', '2010-03-21 23:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912392, 860916, 85849, '<td valign="top">WOW! I think I see a ribbon!</td>', 'WOW! I think I see a ribbon!', '2010-03-21 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912407, 861264, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the different take on the Night Shot theme.  Like the motion blur.  Colors are good too.  Bumping up.</td>', 'I like the different take on the Night Shot theme.  Like the motion blur.  Colors are good too.  Bumping up.', '2010-03-22 00:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912430, 860308, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, love the composition of this shot.  Looks like the Bean in Chicago.  I think the POV view adds drama to the image.  Great elements that you''ve captured; the mist around the skyscrapers, the capture of the skyline in (on?) the bean, the people give the elements scale, great reflections from the wet ground.  This should be a top ten, a ribbon if not the blue.  Bump to 10.</td>', 'Wow, love the composition of this shot.  Looks like the Bean in Chicago.  I think the POV view adds drama to the image.  Great elements that you''ve captured; the mist around the skyscrapers, the capture of the skyline in (on?) the bean, the people give the elements scale, great reflections from the wet ground.  This should be a top ten, a ribbon if not the blue.  Bump to 10.', '2010-03-22 00:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912449, 859998, 103032, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites for this challenge.  A different take from the usual night skyline shot.</td>', 'One of my favorites for this challenge.  A different take from the usual night skyline shot.', '2010-03-22 00:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912470, 860708, 103032, '<td valign="top">Points from me just for being a lensbaby shot.  Love the sense of motion, love the reflection of the wet pavement.  The effect from the LB off the lights are great.</td>', 'Points from me just for being a lensbaby shot.  Love the sense of motion, love the reflection of the wet pavement.  The effect from the LB off the lights are great.', '2010-03-22 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912486, 861047, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great lines from the stairs leading the viewer to the street.  Nice focus on the street and building across.</td>', 'Great lines from the stairs leading the viewer to the street.  Nice focus on the street and building across.', '2010-03-22 00:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912507, 860660, 103032, '<td valign="top">Very stylized noir feel.  Like the lines/pattern of the rail and the lamps leading one further into the shot.  Like the two figures that look like they''re approaching each other.</td>', 'Very stylized noir feel.  Like the lines/pattern of the rail and the lamps leading one further into the shot.  Like the two figures that look like they''re approaching each other.', '2010-03-22 00:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912508, 860522, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured subject under the alley light.  I like how the subject is framed by the walls.  Well done.</td>', 'Nicely captured subject under the alley light.  I like how the subject is framed by the walls.  Well done.', '2010-03-22 00:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912651, 860898, 114056, '<td valign="top">looks a bit over exposed to me</td>', 'looks a bit over exposed to me', '2010-03-22 02:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912652, 860889, 114056, '<td valign="top">Building is not centred, would have been nice to see it cropped to just the left of the big tree on the right side. This would get the building centred and remove the distraction of the dark spot.</td>', 'Building is not centred, would have been nice to see it cropped to just the left of the big tree on the right side. This would get the building centred and remove the distraction of the dark spot.', '2010-03-22 02:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912659, 861088, 114056, '<td valign="top">Really love this shot, fantastic colours. Nice long exposure.</td>', 'Really love this shot, fantastic colours. Nice long exposure.', '2010-03-22 02:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912660, 859946, 114056, '<td valign="top">Lots of noise in this one :(</td>', 'Lots of noise in this one :(', '2010-03-22 02:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912664, 860647, 114056, '<td valign="top">A friend of mine likes the couple on the left, however i would have liked to have seen it without them so you can see the architecture behind. Stunning photo, love the stillness of the water.</td>', 'A friend of mine likes the couple on the left, however i would have liked to have seen it without them so you can see the architecture behind. Stunning photo, love the stillness of the water.', '2010-03-22 02:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912668, 860146, 114056, '<td valign="top">You need to set your whitebalance on night shots manually. Interesting shot however.</td>', 'You need to set your whitebalance on night shots manually. Interesting shot however.', '2010-03-22 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912671, 861038, 114056, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and shadows!</td>', 'Interesting perspective and shadows!', '2010-03-22 02:45:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5912675, 861353, 114056, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Excellent exposure to just have the church (i''m guessing it''s a church) as a light point in the perfect black around it. Pitty this wasn''t an advanced editing so you could clone out the street lights around. oh well :)</td>', 'Nice idea. Excellent exposure to just have the church (i''m guessing it''s a church) as a light point in the perfect black around it. Pitty this wasn''t an advanced editing so you could clone out the street lights around. oh well :)', '2010-03-22 02:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912976, 861046, 18903, '<td valign="top">wow, what a neat effect! the red "la-zers" on the right side buildings are so cool ;)</td>', 'wow, what a neat effect! the red "la-zers" on the right side buildings are so cool ;)', '2010-03-22 08:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912977, 859946, 18903, '<td valign="top">good idea, execution could use some improvement (focus, post...)</td>', 'good idea, execution could use some improvement (focus, post...)', '2010-03-22 08:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912979, 861202, 18903, '<td valign="top">the lighting is really harsh in this one... some additional sources probably would have helped</td>', 'the lighting is really harsh in this one... some additional sources probably would have helped', '2010-03-22 08:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912982, 860124, 18903, '<td valign="top">whooo an invisible train! :) good exposure on this one.</td>', 'whooo an invisible train! :) good exposure on this one.', '2010-03-22 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912984, 860925, 18903, '<td valign="top">good overall, very nice detail in the chruch. <br/>-1 for the crooked horizon tho...</td>', 'good overall, very nice detail in the chruch. -1 for the crooked horizon tho...', '2010-03-22 08:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912988, 860491, 18903, '<td valign="top">lovely composition, but i think the exposure makes it seem more like a cloudy day than a night shot... if you could tell that the road lights were on it would have been more effective</td>', 'lovely composition, but i think the exposure makes it seem more like a cloudy day than a night shot... if you could tell that the road lights were on it would have been more effective', '2010-03-22 09:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912989, 861085, 47974, '<td valign="top">This shot really appeals to me.  The conversion works.</td>', 'This shot really appeals to me.  The conversion works.', '2010-03-22 09:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912992, 860522, 47974, '<td valign="top">One of the best shots in the challenge, love it.</td>', 'One of the best shots in the challenge, love it.', '2010-03-22 09:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912994, 860916, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for Seattle and this is a wonderful shot of the city.</td>', 'I am a sucker for Seattle and this is a wonderful shot of the city.', '2010-03-22 09:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912995, 860647, 47974, '<td valign="top">Have not visited Dubai in a number of years now.  I love shooting there, so many interesting things to see.  Beautiful shot by the way.  Not sure if it would be better with or without the people.</td>', 'Have not visited Dubai in a number of years now.  I love shooting there, so many interesting things to see.  Beautiful shot by the way.  Not sure if it would be better with or without the people.', '2010-03-22 09:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912996, 861355, 47974, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and a beautiful conversion.  Just wish that tree was not to the left.</td>', 'Well exposed and a beautiful conversion.  Just wish that tree was not to the left.', '2010-03-22 09:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912998, 861340, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and what appears to be a light on in the window.</td>', 'Love the colors and what appears to be a light on in the window.', '2010-03-22 09:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5912999, 861222, 47974, '<td valign="top">Simple shot yet well done.  Love it.</td>', 'Simple shot yet well done.  Love it.', '2010-03-22 09:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913001, 860955, 18903, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and shadows, but i think it would have been creepier if the light were cropped out.</td>', 'I like the colours and shadows, but i think it would have been creepier if the light were cropped out.', '2010-03-22 09:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913002, 861197, 47974, '<td valign="top">Not the most dramatic thing to photograph but the colors are stunning and the reflection is perfect.</td>', 'Not the most dramatic thing to photograph but the colors are stunning and the reflection is perfect.', '2010-03-22 09:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913004, 861060, 47974, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2010-03-22 09:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913005, 861075, 47974, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture.  Love how the sky goes from black to the open blue on the right.</td>', 'beautiful capture.  Love how the sky goes from black to the open blue on the right.', '2010-03-22 09:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913006, 860963, 47974, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like daylight.</td>', 'Almost looks like daylight.', '2010-03-22 09:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913007, 861153, 18903, '<td valign="top">hehe neat :) good sharp detail for a night shot!</td>', 'hehe neat :) good sharp detail for a night shot!', '2010-03-22 09:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913011, 860197, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but nothing about it says "night" to me.  Says dark, like in a cave.  Hope you do well</td>', 'Nice shot but nothing about it says "night" to me.  Says dark, like in a cave.  Hope you do well', '2010-03-22 09:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913013, 860325, 18903, '<td valign="top">whaaaahh!<br/>great composition, perspective &amp; foreground lighting, but a few minutes later probably would have gotten the sky dark enough to really hit the "night" sky</td>', 'whaaaahh!great composition, perspective & foreground lighting, but a few minutes later probably would have gotten the sky dark enough to really hit the "night" sky', '2010-03-22 09:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913014, 861322, 47974, '<td valign="top">Looks more like an underexposed day time shot then a night shot</td>', 'Looks more like an underexposed day time shot then a night shot', '2010-03-22 09:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913015, 860960, 18903, '<td valign="top">lovely colours!</td>', 'lovely colours!', '2010-03-22 09:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913016, 861307, 47974, '<td valign="top">Would have rated higher if not for the building in the lower left.</td>', 'Would have rated higher if not for the building in the lower left.', '2010-03-22 09:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913019, 861194, 18903, '<td valign="top">the lacking technical attributes (sharpness, colour, lighting, etc) definitely contribute artistically to this one. good composition with the light sitting "right in front" of the camera, really leads your eye to the subject</td>', 'the lacking technical attributes (sharpness, colour, lighting, etc) definitely contribute artistically to this one. good composition with the light sitting "right in front" of the camera, really leads your eye to the subject', '2010-03-22 09:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913020, 861347, 18903, '<td valign="top">-1 for the harsh orange border... otherwise not a bad shot</td>', '-1 for the harsh orange border... otherwise not a bad shot', '2010-03-22 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913021, 860697, 18903, '<td valign="top">very creative! i find the background a bit distracting tho, and the half-dozen really bright spots on the left as well...</td>', 'very creative! i find the background a bit distracting tho, and the half-dozen really bright spots on the left as well...', '2010-03-22 09:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913023, 861210, 18903, '<td valign="top">the pair of blue lights are the only thing keeping this one from a 10... great perspective, and the lighting (other than the aforementioned) really accents the architecture and contributes to the atmosphere...</td>', 'the pair of blue lights are the only thing keeping this one from a 10... great perspective, and the lighting (other than the aforementioned) really accents the architecture and contributes to the atmosphere...', '2010-03-22 09:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913024, 860916, 18903, '<td valign="top">i could see this one as a postcard!</td>', 'i could see this one as a postcard!', '2010-03-22 09:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913035, 860647, 18903, '<td valign="top">the ''squashed'' people on the left are a distraction... but otherwise a fantastic shot! great use of wideangle!</td>', 'the ''squashed'' people on the left are a distraction... but otherwise a fantastic shot! great use of wideangle!', '2010-03-22 09:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913036, 861178, 18903, '<td valign="top">i think a slightly darker exposure would keep the effect but reduce the harshness of the lighting. nice natural framing with the trees.</td>', 'i think a slightly darker exposure would keep the effect but reduce the harshness of the lighting. nice natural framing with the trees.', '2010-03-22 09:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913416, 861085, 103048, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2010-03-22 14:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913418, 861153, 103048, '<td valign="top">Good job finding this curve</td>', 'Good job finding this curve', '2010-03-22 14:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913422, 861210, 27608, '<td valign="top">This looks like Hart House at UofT!!  Image seems slighty under exposed and a bit noisy/blurry.  I like sky.</td>', 'This looks like Hart House at UofT!!  Image seems slighty under exposed and a bit noisy/blurry.  I like sky.', '2010-03-22 14:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913426, 861088, 103048, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2010-03-22 14:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913502, 861181, 27608, '<td valign="top">I love the blue here!!  Really cool</td>', 'I love the blue here!!  Really cool', '2010-03-22 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913787, 861075, 106349, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous!!!</td>', 'This is gorgeous!!!', '2010-03-22 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913788, 860647, 106349, '<td valign="top">This shot is beautiful... except for the people walking the other way. However, I don''t think it takes too much away from the beauty of the shot. I also see a bit too much noise in the sky (do you use noise reduction software?).</td>', 'This shot is beautiful... except for the people walking the other way. However, I don''t think it takes too much away from the beauty of the shot. I also see a bit too much noise in the sky (do you use noise reduction software?).', '2010-03-22 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913827, 861181, 108544, '<td valign="top">Planes can be very addictive to shoot. The sight and sounds really add to the experience. It must have been a blast!<br/>Image wise, Nice capture and the slope in the background is great! Interesting how the bridge looks with the different lighting. Yeah, the water is sweet too! Very much my kind of shot.</td>', 'Planes can be very addictive to shoot. The sight and sounds really add to the experience. It must have been a blast!Image wise, Nice capture and the slope in the background is great! Interesting how the bridge looks with the different lighting. Yeah, the water is sweet too! Very much my kind of shot.', '2010-03-22 21:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913830, 860894, 108544, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I find the white balance a little warm. Oh and if you do a reshoot, try reajusting the rearview mirror. It would be sick to see an intence stair or expresion. Don''t get me wrong though, I find I am really exploring this image. Yeah good job!</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I find the white balance a little warm. Oh and if you do a reshoot, try reajusting the rearview mirror. It would be sick to see an intence stair or expresion. Don''t get me wrong though, I find I am really exploring this image. Yeah good job!', '2010-03-22 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913834, 861038, 108544, '<td valign="top">Great idea to shoot after the rain. The lighting plays very well with this area. Exposure looks great and colour is well handled. Excellent job!</td>', 'Great idea to shoot after the rain. The lighting plays very well with this area. Exposure looks great and colour is well handled. Excellent job!', '2010-03-22 21:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5913836, 860146, 108544, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the reflections and sky colour.</td>', 'Great shot! Love the reflections and sky colour.', '2010-03-22 21:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914086, 861085, 66616, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2010-03-23 05:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914088, 860961, 66616, '<td valign="top">nice work</td>', 'nice work', '2010-03-23 05:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914123, 861065, 115873, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. It''s my desktop background.<br/>i loveeee iiiiiitttttttttttt!!</td>', 'Wonderful picture. It''s my desktop background.i loveeee iiiiiitttttttttttt!!', '2010-03-23 08:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914203, 861047, 91976, '<td valign="top">nice graphism ...</td>', 'nice graphism ...', '2010-03-23 09:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914204, 860182, 43774, '<td valign="top">Bowring Park, right?</td>', 'Bowring Park, right?', '2010-03-23 09:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914205, 860163, 43774, '<td valign="top">Quidi Vidi?</td>', 'Quidi Vidi?', '2010-03-23 09:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914350, 861160, 60495, '<td valign="top">with the shoreline being centered I think it would help the shot to have the shoreline level, the lights for the buildings also appear like UFO''s in the sky which distract''s from subject of the shot. Not really sure what you could do about the lights except maybe take the shot at dawn or dusk so the building outlines are still there so the lights are not just dots in the sky. Good luck in the challenge - 5</td>', 'with the shoreline being centered I think it would help the shot to have the shoreline level, the lights for the buildings also appear like UFO''s in the sky which distract''s from subject of the shot. Not really sure what you could do about the lights except maybe take the shot at dawn or dusk so the building outlines are still there so the lights are not just dots in the sky. Good luck in the challenge - 5', '2010-03-23 11:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914351, 859984, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, I like the way you kept the Texas license plate and the skull in the back ground.</td>', 'Nicely done, I like the way you kept the Texas license plate and the skull in the back ground.', '2010-03-23 11:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914354, 860879, 60495, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is some good driving, didn''t miss a single one!</td>', 'Wow, that is some good driving, didn''t miss a single one!', '2010-03-23 11:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914361, 860708, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, I would love to see how this one was captured. I like the way the zoom blur gave the lights an oval shape and hot the person, street and car only have a slight blur!</td>', 'Nice effect, I would love to see how this one was captured. I like the way the zoom blur gave the lights an oval shape and hot the person, street and car only have a slight blur!', '2010-03-23 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914364, 861153, 60495, '<td valign="top">Title cracked me up, very cool road for this shot. Nice control on exposure to get the headlights and tail lights pretty evenly lit.</td>', 'Title cracked me up, very cool road for this shot. Nice control on exposure to get the headlights and tail lights pretty evenly lit.', '2010-03-23 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914367, 860660, 106910, '<td valign="top">This one was my absolute favorite of the challenge - it has an emotion and certain ambiance that draws me into it. Good job! 10</td>', 'This one was my absolute favorite of the challenge - it has an emotion and certain ambiance that draws me into it. Good job! 10', '2010-03-23 12:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914368, 861153, 106910, '<td valign="top">I love it! How''d you get the green?</td>', 'I love it! How''d you get the green?', '2010-03-23 12:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914369, 861046, 106910, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors - I love it.</td>', 'Beautiful colors - I love it.', '2010-03-23 12:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914371, 860764, 106910, '<td valign="top">Of course mustangs break down :D I like the narrative in this one.</td>', 'Of course mustangs break down :D I like the narrative in this one.', '2010-03-23 12:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914373, 861061, 106910, '<td valign="top">Nice foreground - but I wish there was something important on the other side of the window. Still, great picture. I like the b/w.</td>', 'Nice foreground - but I wish there was something important on the other side of the window. Still, great picture. I like the b/w.', '2010-03-23 12:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914374, 860512, 106910, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice balance to this photo - I wish the moon was higher though. Too much empty space in the upper 3rd imho.</td>', 'There''s a nice balance to this photo - I wish the moon was higher though. Too much empty space in the upper 3rd imho.', '2010-03-23 12:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914409, 861172, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting contrast between the old sailing ship and the modern building. Good balance of the yellow lights with the dark blue sky.</td>', 'An interesting contrast between the old sailing ship and the modern building. Good balance of the yellow lights with the dark blue sky.', '2010-03-23 13:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914415, 860708, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gives the impression that the driver is gunning after the guy in the foreground. Perhaps could it use a touch of noise reduction, but otherwise I like this, in part because it makes me wonder what is going on.</td>', 'Gives the impression that the driver is gunning after the guy in the foreground. Perhaps could it use a touch of noise reduction, but otherwise I like this, in part because it makes me wonder what is going on.', '2010-03-23 13:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914418, 861040, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is some modest but visible tilt to this that is easily corrected in most photo editing apps.</td>', 'There is some modest but visible tilt to this that is easily corrected in most photo editing apps.', '2010-03-23 13:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914421, 861293, 83313, '<td valign="top">Dam fine shot.</td>', 'Dam fine shot.', '2010-03-23 13:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914422, 861250, 83313, '<td valign="top">Two shots of Jacksonville in the same challenge... A nice change of pace. I was getting bored with all the shots of Toronto.</td>', 'Two shots of Jacksonville in the same challenge... A nice change of pace. I was getting bored with all the shots of Toronto.', '2010-03-23 13:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5914423, 861359, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting clounds and light, but the image as a whole isn''t really grabbing my interest somehow. Perhaps there just isn''t enough here. Not really sure...</td>', 'Interesting clounds and light, but the image as a whole isn''t really grabbing my interest somehow. Perhaps there just isn''t enough here. Not really sure...', '2010-03-23 13:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
