(5914426, 861081, 83313, '<td valign="top">The stars are great, the muddied look of the glow over the city is bringing it down a touch, however. I expect this was a tough shot to get perfect under basic rules.</td>', 'The stars are great, the muddied look of the glow over the city is bringing it down a touch, however. I expect this was a tough shot to get perfect under basic rules.', '2010-03-23 13:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
