(5915136, 861265, 113900, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the entire challenge.  I like the choice of grainy B&amp;W look.  Very good job and not rated near as high as it should have been IMHO.  Good job jminso!</td>', 'One of my favorites in the entire challenge.  I like the choice of grainy B&W look.  Very good job and not rated near as high as it should have been IMHO.  Good job jminso!', '2010-03-24 00:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915149, 860608, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue!!!</td>', 'Congrats on the blue!!!', '2010-03-24 00:20:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915153, 861075, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Citadel:</b></div><hr/><i> Funny, I like your composition better than wolf''s. I also wonder if have two similar shots in the same challenge might have hurt your score a bit. (I could be totally wrong though). In any event congrats on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you! :)  <br/> <br/>In previous challenges I have wondered that, but I didn''t get any comments during voting regarding the similarity, so I don''t think it made any difference in this challenge. Besides, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27608" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">wolf</a>''s shot has a much different feel to it because of the zoom blur. I think his shot is incredible. <br/> <br/>For Reference:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=861046" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1182/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_861046.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1182/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_861046.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1182/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_861046.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by Citadel: Funny, I like your composition better than wolf''s. I also wonder if have two similar shots in the same challenge might have hurt your score a bit. (I could be totally wrong though). In any event congrats on the ribbon!   Thank you! :)   In previous challenges I have wondered that, but I didn''t get any comments during voting regarding the similarity, so I don''t think it made any difference in this challenge. Besides,  wolf''s shot has a much different feel to it because of the zoom blur. I think his shot is incredible.  For Reference:', '2010-03-24 00:20:56.000000', NULL, 0),
