(5915208, 861358, 83313, '<td valign="top">In spite of the obvious problem of the darkness, I gave this a 6 for what you did accomplish with it. I see you started making "anticipated critiques" notes as well. It''s an excellent way of developing a critical eye for your own work.</td>', 'In spite of the obvious problem of the darkness, I gave this a 6 for what you did accomplish with it. I see you started making "anticipated critiques" notes as well. It''s an excellent way of developing a critical eye for your own work.', '2010-03-24 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
