(5915359, 860960, 57202, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Robert!  Yeah, I''m beyond impressed with the low light capability of this camera. :)  The 20D was awesome, but ISO 1600 on the 5D MKII is like 400 or lower on the 20D. :D  And thank you to everyone who voted and left comments!</td>', 'Thanks, Robert!  Yeah, I''m beyond impressed with the low light capability of this camera. :)  The 20D was awesome, but ISO 1600 on the 5D MKII is like 400 or lower on the 20D. :D  And thank you to everyone who voted and left comments!', '2010-03-24 02:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
