(5915464, 861317, 12796, '<td valign="top">good photo. definitely conveys it is night time and no takers are there for the petrol. However, it would have given a different emotion if there was just one car at night.<br/> <br/>Tower seems to be slightly tilted, maybe by a degree or half to me.<br/>But otherwise just fit the challenge rightly.</td>', 'good photo. definitely conveys it is night time and no takers are there for the petrol. However, it would have given a different emotion if there was just one car at night. Tower seems to be slightly tilted, maybe by a degree or half to me.But otherwise just fit the challenge rightly.', '2010-03-24 05:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915466, 861148, 12796, '<td valign="top">good night shot, but exactly as how you have worried, certain areas are washed out due to overexposure. I firmly believe if you had boosted up the ISO to 800, and slightly stepped up your aperture to something like F/8, you could have ended up in a better shutter say close to 1 Sec, you could have avoided this.<br/> <br/>I don''t feel the hand rails to be a distraction, but it rather helps me by directing to the painter.</td>', 'good night shot, but exactly as how you have worried, certain areas are washed out due to overexposure. I firmly believe if you had boosted up the ISO to 800, and slightly stepped up your aperture to something like F/8, you could have ended up in a better shutter say close to 1 Sec, you could have avoided this. I don''t feel the hand rails to be a distraction, but it rather helps me by directing to the painter.', '2010-03-24 05:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
