(5915517, 860497, 113278, '<td valign="top">Great shot and one of my higher votes. This shot really makes me feel like I am there but not at the same time. Almost like being in a dream, great shot. Posting this on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.</td>', 'Great shot and one of my higher votes. This shot really makes me feel like I am there but not at the same time. Almost like being in a dream, great shot. Posting this on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.', '2010-03-24 07:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915521, 860197, 113278, '<td valign="top">There is so much that can be said about this shot and it was one of my higher votes at a 9. It is simple yet open to interpetation. For me it conveys a lost soul reaching out of the darkness but they will just keep reaching for something that isn''t there. Or it could just be a photo of a hand. That is what I love about it, it can be almost anything you want. Great job and much under appreciated. Posting this on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.</td>', 'There is so much that can be said about this shot and it was one of my higher votes at a 9. It is simple yet open to interpetation. For me it conveys a lost soul reaching out of the darkness but they will just keep reaching for something that isn''t there. Or it could just be a photo of a hand. That is what I love about it, it can be almost anything you want. Great job and much under appreciated. Posting this on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread.', '2010-03-24 07:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5915524, 861249, 113278, '<td valign="top">Well I only gave this a 9 but I suppose I should have combated all of the ridiculously low votes and gave this a 10. This shot is great on so many levels. Love it, and if I had an award I would give one to you but alas I do not. So I will do this instead and post it on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread but you are probably already there. Good job.</td>', 'Well I only gave this a 9 but I suppose I should have combated all of the ridiculously low votes and gave this a 10. This shot is great on so many levels. Love it, and if I had an award I would give one to you but alas I do not. So I will do this instead and post it on the Posthumous Ribbons, Part IV thread but you are probably already there. Good job.', '2010-03-24 07:29:25.000000', NULL, 0),
