(5916201, 861340, 35086, '<td valign="top">The fact that you ''painted'' that window with light really helps out a lot.  I usually just bring a flashlight when I paint with light but this is something that I''ll definitely try to sure.  The tone really adds another layer to the picture, making it very eerie.  The details, the stars through the thin moving clouds and the structure itself are all very nice elements.  This is some interesting work indeed, I really like this a lot.</td>', 'The fact that you ''painted'' that window with light really helps out a lot.  I usually just bring a flashlight when I paint with light but this is something that I''ll definitely try to sure.  The tone really adds another layer to the picture, making it very eerie.  The details, the stars through the thin moving clouds and the structure itself are all very nice elements.  This is some interesting work indeed, I really like this a lot.', '2010-03-24 15:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5916209, 861085, 35086, '<td valign="top">I really like how the long exposure makes it seem as though the stars are raining down, it''s a very beautiful shot.  Congrats on 4th, definitely worthy of a top rank!</td>', 'I really like how the long exposure makes it seem as though the stars are raining down, it''s a very beautiful shot.  Congrats on 4th, definitely worthy of a top rank!', '2010-03-24 15:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5916252, 860916, 19936, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, Brent! An awesome job! 7.47 average with 16 sub-5 votes - that''s quite excellent. This is one of those very rare times where I wish I knew who voted below 5. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Admit it Art, it was you!  We know you have always hated Seattle.  Ever since you arrived in that damn ship that now its on a stalk and blights our City!  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=436425" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_436425.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_436425.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_436425.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Brent congratulations despite those trolls!</td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Congrats, Brent! An awesome job! 7.47 average with 16 sub-5 votes - that''s quite excellent. This is one of those very rare times where I wish I knew who voted below 5.   Admit it Art, it was you!  We know you have always hated Seattle.  Ever since you arrived in that damn ship that now its on a stalk and blights our City!    Brent congratulations despite those trolls!', '2010-03-24 16:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5916265, 860308, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Congrats!</td>', 'Great perspective. Congrats!', '2010-03-24 16:18:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5916280, 860916, 96530, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jbsmithana:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, Brent! An awesome job! 7.47 average with 16 sub-5 votes - that''s quite excellent. This is one of those very rare times where I wish I knew who voted below 5. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Admit it Art, it was you!  We know you have always hated Seattle.  Ever since you arrived in that damn ship that now its on a stalk and blights our City!  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=436425" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_436425.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_436425.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_436425.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Brent congratulations despite those trolls! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>LOL! Yeah that probably was Ken the alien trolling me from several secret DPC accounts J.B. ;-) Yeah, I really don''t know what was up with all those ones and twos. It''s not like I did over the top processing that some might just hate? I even specifically scouted out a new location so I wouldn''t be seen as milking the Kerry Park view (which happens to be where I live). Things worked out okay anyway... :-)</td>', 'Originally posted by jbsmithana: Originally posted by Art Roflmao: Congrats, Brent! An awesome job! 7.47 average with 16 sub-5 votes - that''s quite excellent. This is one of those very rare times where I wish I knew who voted below 5.   Admit it Art, it was you!  We know you have always hated Seattle.  Ever since you arrived in that damn ship that now its on a stalk and blights our City!    Brent congratulations despite those trolls!  LOL! Yeah that probably was Ken the alien trolling me from several secret DPC accounts J.B. ;-) Yeah, I really don''t know what was up with all those ones and twos. It''s not like I did over the top processing that some might just hate? I even specifically scouted out a new location so I wouldn''t be seen as milking the Kerry Park view (which happens to be where I live). Things worked out okay anyway... :-)', '2010-03-24 16:29:47.000000', NULL, 0),
