(5924869, 860660, 50641, '<td valign="top">very noiry!  i adore the dotted line motif!</td>', 'very noiry!  i adore the dotted line motif!', '2010-04-01 06:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5926178, 861144, 79720, '<td valign="top">OK, a couple of things that might help, if I may be so presumptuous. The location you chose let you down somewhat...the pier/yacht club structures seem to blend in to the skyline, making it look as if it''s part of the city, not a ferry-ride separating the two. Next, the post processing routine you chose left some really weird artifacts around the top of the office buildings...see that patch of oversaturated blue? On a positive note, I really dig how the reflection of the tower in the still water looks.</td>', 'OK, a couple of things that might help, if I may be so presumptuous. The location you chose let you down somewhat...the pier/yacht club structures seem to blend in to the skyline, making it look as if it''s part of the city, not a ferry-ride separating the two. Next, the post processing routine you chose left some really weird artifacts around the top of the office buildings...see that patch of oversaturated blue? On a positive note, I really dig how the reflection of the tower in the still water looks.', '2010-04-01 19:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5935981, 860879, 16106, '<td valign="top">I love the chaotic dissymetry, the tie in between the color of the cones and the sky, the uncomfortably close crop at the top of the frame, and the use of the wideangle to bend the horizon to create a feeling of menacing unreality. I don''t know why this shot makes me laugh.</td>', 'I love the chaotic dissymetry, the tie in between the color of the cones and the sky, the uncomfortably close crop at the top of the frame, and the use of the wideangle to bend the horizon to create a feeling of menacing unreality. I don''t know why this shot makes me laugh.', '2010-04-07 18:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5948118, 861317, 62357, '<td valign="top">WOW, I hadn''t seen this before, that''s really an excellent night shot.  Do not understand the score though.  Although, heck, why should I be surprised, this is DPC after all!  And I do have a bit of a love affair with gas station shots (not that I have ever taken any, but I do gravitate towards them).</td>', 'WOW, I hadn''t seen this before, that''s really an excellent night shot.  Do not understand the score though.  Although, heck, why should I be surprised, this is DPC after all!  And I do have a bit of a love affair with gas station shots (not that I have ever taken any, but I do gravitate towards them).', '2010-04-15 14:06:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5961891, 860764, 93565, '<td valign="top">You know, looking at ths, I don''t really know what to suggest. You have many elements that improve a photo... women in good shape, slight DoF effect, and it meets the challenge. But I would say that for some reason things are not active or dynamic enough. Lighting up the left subject''s face would have really added to things, but required an additional strobe. Concept is good though.</td>', 'You know, looking at ths, I don''t really know what to suggest. You have many elements that improve a photo... women in good shape, slight DoF effect, and it meets the challenge. But I would say that for some reason things are not active or dynamic enough. Lighting up the left subject''s face would have really added to things, but required an additional strobe. Concept is good though.', '2010-04-21 16:41:24.000000', NULL, 0),
